# Line endings that matter.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows and executed in WSL/Linux containers. With
# the default core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout writes CRLF, and a shell
# script that starts with `set -euo pipefail` then dies with
# "set: pipefail: invalid option name" — hit on 2026-11-03 when a script was
# rewritten through a Windows text-mode writer.
#
# These types run as-is on Linux, so pin them to LF regardless of platform.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.bash  text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.pug   text eol=lf
Dockerfile*      text eol=lf
*.dockerignore   text eol=lf
.gitignore       text eol=lf
.gitattributes   text eol=lf
